      "timestamp_raw": "May 30, 2018 20:36:36 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Looking great <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-177 group-0\" href=\"/user/177\" itemprop=\"url\" title=\"@almightydolla\"><span itemprop=\"name\">almightydolla</span></a></span> and <span itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\"><a class=\"user-link js-user-link user-961 group-9\" href=\"/user/961\" itemprop=\"url\" title=\"@beautytubes\"><span itemprop=\"name\">beautytubes</span></a></span>!<br/>Here are a couple collection overview shots from last weekend:<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/26g39wB\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/882/41520642735_fb463ba8da_b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/26g39wB\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Untitled</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/150907390@N02/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Calen Hall</a>, on Flickr<br/>Red flava / flava ornata bed:<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27ymqxq\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/902/42372945822_7ffd3ccb25_b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27ymqxq\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Untitled</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/150907390@N02/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Calen Hall</a>, on Flickr<br/>Chunky! S. x moorei (Hurricane Creek White Clone F x rugelii JL403):<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24T2J8w\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm2.staticflickr.com/1738/40615240980_f6bc44b39c_b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24T2J8w\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Untitled</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/150907390@N02/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Calen Hall</a>, on Flickr<br/>A moorei seedling showing some promise:<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/KuS2Ku\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm2.staticflickr.com/1726/28549964398_9ac9c0a8ed_b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/KuS2Ku\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Untitled</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/150907390@N02/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Calen Hall</a>, on Flickr<br/>",
      "body_text": "Looking great\nalmightydolla\nand\nbeautytubes\n!\nHere are a couple collection overview shots from last weekend:\nUntitled\nby\nCalen Hall\n, on Flickr\nRed flava / flava ornata bed:\nUntitled\nby\nCalen Hall\n, on Flickr\nChunky! S. x moorei (Hurricane Creek White Clone F x rugelii JL403):\nUntitled\nby\nCalen Hall\n, on Flickr\nA moorei seedling showing some promise:\nUntitled\nby\nCalen Hall\n, on Flickr",
